      "docs": [
        "A registered agent takes the fixed payout (see `quote_claim`): first come, first served. The",
        "first payout can be claimed right after registering; after that, one per `cooldown_secs`. When",
        "the vault holds less than a payout the claim fails and costs the caller only the network fee."
